{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1575","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"“心生而言立，言立而文明。”（《文心雕龙·原道》）古人将自己的人生感悟、事理思考、情感体验等诉诸笔墨，留下了许多佳作名篇。诵读这些作品，触摸民族文化血脉，可以增进我们对中华优秀传统文化的理解。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元选取魏晋到明代的六篇经典散文，有的以情见长，至情至性，感人肺腑；有的以理取胜，理趣盎然，发人深思。这些作品体裁不一，风格各异，呈现了我国古代散文的多样面貌。集中在一个单元研习，在对比中体会，在联系中思考，可以帮助我们更全面地了解古代散文。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，重在把握课文的思想情感及其承载的文化观念，领会不同作者在审美上的独特追求。要反复诵读，涵泳品味，把握文意；要理解作者如何通过特有的语言形式去抒发情志，形成独特的美感；还要做些梳理和评点，领会章法之妙和细节之美。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":95175,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/3/311034841bd3ac71742de7ceb012ab8018968ba7.jpeg","height":547,"id":"media-066e0757614fadb3f003","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"c377fea80584c427dc52075b3e3e181d1a50047af896b59eba10d4c126b8f48e","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/3/311034841bd3ac71742de7ceb012ab8018968ba7.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":809}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10518,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/